            "value": "有效范围 1–65535。修改后服务器将全量重启；如果使用 Docker bridge，通常只需调整宿主侧端口映射。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Valid range 1–65535. The server fully restarts after a change; with Docker bridge networking, usually only the host-side port mapping needs changing."
          }
