            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按端点方言选择；声明后会话输入框出现思考档位选择器，档位只从声明的菜单里选（不做就近换算）。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose the endpoint’s dialect. Once declared, the composer shows a thinking-level picker with only the declared levels (no nearest-level mapping)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähle den Dialekt des Endpunkts. Sobald er deklariert ist, zeigt der Komponist ein Picker mit den definierten Levels an (keine näheren Level-Mapping)."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Settings."
    },
    "settings.llmForm.offHint": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅当端点有真正的关闭参数时勾选（如 enable_thinking=false）；勾选后档位菜单多出「关」。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅当端点有真正的关闭参数时勾选（如 enable_thinking=false）；勾选后档位菜单多出「关」。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select only if the endpoint has a real off switch (such as enable_thinking=false); the level menu then includes Off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
